    {
      "bbox": [
        442.1043395996094,
        640.2764282226562,
        486.0143127441406,
        653.58642578125
      ],
      "text": "Chapter 7",
      "font": "ArialMT",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        100.15750122070312,
        657.014892578125,
        547.37060546875,
        669.014892578125
      ],
      "text": "The standard code for anti-TB treatment regimens uses an abbreviation for each anti-TB drug: isoniazid (H), rifampicin (R),  a",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        114.33070373535156,
        666.6149291992188,
        547.3947143554688,
        678.6149291992188
      ],
      "text": "pyrazinamide (Z) and ethambutol (E). A regimen consists of two phases - the initial and continuation phases. The number at the",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        114.33070373535156,
        676.2149047851562,
        547.3629150390625,
        688.2149047851562
      ],
      "text": "front of each phase represents the duration of that phase in months. Example, 2HRZ: Duration of this phase is 2 months and",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        114.33070373535156,
        685.8148803710938,
        502.9789123535156,
        697.8148803710938
      ],
      "text": "drug treatment is daily (no subscript numbers after the abbreviations) with isoniazid, rifampicin and pyrazinamide.",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        100.15750122070312,
        704.0841674804688,
        547.426513671875,
        716.0841674804688
      ],
      "text": "See “Definitions and distinctions” section for discussion of WHO definitions of high and low prevalence of HIV and isoniazid  b",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        114.33070373535156,
        713.6842041015625,
        151.37872314453125,
        725.6842041015625
      ],
      "text": "resistance.",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        100.15750122070312,
        731.9534301757812,
        547.39501953125,
        743.9534301757812
      ],
      "text": "The decision on the regimen for a child with tuberculous meningitis should be made by an experienced clinician.  It is suggested  c",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        114.33070373535156,
        742.75341796875,
        249.02662658691406,
        754.75341796875
      ],
      "text": "that the patient be treated in a hospital.",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
